{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Abyss&quot; plunges players into a sinister and bewildering world, where the line between reality and nightmare blurs. After a serious car accident, the protagonist becomes trapped in a deep coma and awakens in a dark place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes control of the protagonist, who must explore this shadowy realm in first-person, confronting indescribable horrors and solving twisted puzzles while struggling to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they progress, the player uncovers fragments of the protagonist's story, revealing dark secrets and hidden traumas that intertwine with the nature of the Abyss itself. The environments constantly shift, immersing the player in claustrophobic and surreal settings that defy sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each terrifying encounter and every challenge overcome, the player edges closer to the truth behind the Abyss and the reason why the protagonist became trapped in this dark world. Will the protagonist confront their own inner demons and find a way out, or will they succumb to the relentless darkness of The Abyss?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2522860?t=1772629094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522860/191f6f173f426e650a8e842554416c2437207fa1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772629094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522860/40b08a0bd43c1ad754f99bfe84e31d91a40390f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772629094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522860/40b08a0bd43c1ad754f99bfe84e31d91a40390f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772629094","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3376100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"b